{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><i><strong>Crit Happens!</strong></i><strong> </strong>is a<strong> dice-building, turn-based roguelike</strong>\u00a0where you roll your dice to attack! The higher your roll, the more damage you'll deal with your attacks. You can roll your dice at least <strong>3</strong> times, and <strong>hold</strong> the dice you're happy with. It's up to you to balance <strong>risk</strong> vs <strong>reward</strong>.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3711540/extras/11b7451045369b31b9b98035e42eae69.poster.avif?t=1773918127\" width=1170 height=260 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3711540/extras/11b7451045369b31b9b98035e42eae69.webm?t=1773918127\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3711540/extras/11b7451045369b31b9b98035e42eae69.mp4?t=1773918127\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span> </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Acquire powerful <strong>trinkets</strong> and <strong>relics</strong> as you travel through these dangerous lands, changing the way you think about each turn. <strong>Trinkets</strong> will particularly change the way you tackle each turn; <strong>trinkets</strong> set objectives that must be met in order to apply unique <strong>multipliers</strong> to your attack. Your currently active <strong>trinket</strong> is always cycling through your collection at the end of each turn, so you'll be re-thinking your dice rolls all the time!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3711540/extras/2e4fc16172181411bcba6ca0dec43c3e.poster.avif?t=1773918127\" width=1170 height=260 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3711540/extras/2e4fc16172181411bcba6ca0dec43c3e.webm?t=1773918127\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3711540/extras/2e4fc16172181411bcba6ca0dec43c3e.mp4?t=1773918127\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Finding new <strong>dice faces</strong> on your journey and crafting them onto your dice will allow you to apply <strong>special effects</strong> to your attacks! Upgrading your dice will be essential to conquering the dungeons! With the right dice you'll be able to inflict <strong>status effects</strong> on enemies, like\u00a0<i>burn</i>, <i>bleed</i>, <i>paralysis</i> or <i>confusion</i>. Some dice can even apply <strong>buffs</strong> to yourself, like <i>shield</i> or <i>reflect</i>.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3711540/extras/cea09dc7b991efd2cb95d78bf2dd7aea.poster.avif?t=1773918127\" width=800 height=342 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3711540/extras/cea09dc7b991efd2cb95d78bf2dd7aea.webm?t=1773918127\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3711540/extras/cea09dc7b991efd2cb95d78bf2dd7aea.mp4?t=1773918127\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Features:</strong></h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Build your dice as you play, enhancing your strength as you continue your journey.</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >There are a variety of dice faces you'll find on your adventure, each with its own unique effect that can be applied to your attacks. You'll get to fully customize each of your dice each time you find a new face.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Change the way you play by discovering new trinkets and relics.</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Trinkets can be found throughout your journey; each affecting the way your attack is calculated. Each turn will cycle through your collection of trinkets, forcing you to tackle each turn from a different perspective. Relics offer permanent effects, empowering certain dice faces, or simply increasing your health.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Journey across the dangerous, ever-shifting lands.</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The world is ever-changing, with no two runs being the same. Travel through harsh deserts and blistering snowstorms, as you choose your path via your trusty map. Will you prioritize safe havens, or brave the elite enemies in hope of rewards?</p></li></ul>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3711540?t=1773918127","background_raw":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3711540/3e73b39d895c9128c47f637788556f087bc9ce69/page_bg_raw.jpg?t=1773918127","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3711540/4a5711c4bfdf6f05621396c8dfa867b1a4b4da77/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1773918127","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3711540/4a5711c4bfdf6f05621396c8dfa867b1a4b4da77/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1773918127","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2},{"description":"Full controller support","id":28},{"description":"Playable without Timed Input","id":74},{"description":"Stereo Sound","id":69},{"description":"Family Sharing","id":62}],"content_descriptors":{"ids":[],"notes":null},"controller_support":"full","demos":[{"appid":3737160,"description":""}],"detailed_description":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><i><strong>Crit Happens!</strong></i><strong> </strong>is a<strong> dice-building, turn-based roguelike</strong>\u00a0where you roll your dice to attack! The higher your roll, the more damage you'll deal with your attacks. You can roll your dice at least <strong>3</strong> times, and <strong>hold</strong> the dice you're happy with. It's up to you to balance <strong>risk</strong> vs <strong>reward</strong>.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3711540/extras/11b7451045369b31b9b98035e42eae69.poster.avif?t=1773918127\" width=1170 height=260 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3711540/extras/11b7451045369b31b9b98035e42eae69.webm?t=1773918127\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3711540/extras/11b7451045369b31b9b98035e42eae69.mp4?t=1773918127\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span> </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Acquire powerful <strong>trinkets</strong> and <strong>relics</strong> as you travel through these dangerous lands, changing the way you think about each turn. <strong>Trinkets</strong> will particularly change the way you tackle each turn; <strong>trinkets</strong> set objectives that must be met in order to apply unique <strong>multipliers</strong> to your attack. Your currently active <strong>trinket</strong> is always cycling through your collection at the end of each turn, so you'll be re-thinking your dice rolls all the time!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3711540/extras/2e4fc16172181411bcba6ca0dec43c3e.poster.avif?t=1773918127\" width=1170 height=260 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3711540/extras/2e4fc16172181411bcba6ca0dec43c3e.webm?t=1773918127\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3711540/extras/2e4fc16172181411bcba6ca0dec43c3e.mp4?t=1773918127\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Finding new <strong>dice faces</strong> on your journey and crafting them onto your dice will allow you to apply <strong>special effects</strong> to your attacks! Upgrading your dice will be essential to conquering the dungeons! With the right dice you'll be able to inflict <strong>status effects</strong> on enemies, like\u00a0<i>burn</i>, <i>bleed</i>, <i>paralysis</i> or <i>confusion</i>. Some dice can even apply <strong>buffs</strong> to yourself, like <i>shield</i> or <i>reflect</i>.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3711540/extras/cea09dc7b991efd2cb95d78bf2dd7aea.poster.avif?t=1773918127\" width=800 height=342 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3711540/extras/cea09dc7b991efd2cb95d78bf2dd7aea.webm?t=1773918127\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3711540/extras/cea09dc7b991efd2cb95d78bf2dd7aea.mp4?t=1773918127\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Features:</strong></h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Build your dice as you play, enhancing your strength as you continue your journey.</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >There are a variety of dice faces you'll find on your adventure, each with its own unique effect that can be applied to your attacks. You'll get to fully customize each of your dice each time you find a new face.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Change the way you play by discovering new trinkets and relics.</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Trinkets can be found throughout your journey; each affecting the way your attack is calculated. Each turn will cycle through your collection of trinkets, forcing you to tackle each turn from a different perspective. Relics offer permanent effects, empowering certain dice faces, or simply increasing your health.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Journey across the dangerous, ever-shifting lands.</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The world is ever-changing, with no two runs being the same. Travel through harsh deserts and blistering snowstorms, as you choose your path via your trusty map. Will you prioritize safe havens, or brave the elite enemies in hope of rewards?</p></li></ul>","developers":["Studio Alone"],"genres":[{"description":"Indie","id":"23"},{"description":"RPG","id":"3"},{"description":"Strategy","id":"2"}],"header_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3711540/0c8c421a26934cab13a33ebaae5c2e7a502a740e/header.jpg?t=1773918127","is_free":false,"linux_requirements":[],"mac_requirements":[],"movies":[{"dash_av1":"https://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/3711540/482909058/41b6afeae4269d8a8760c5c368e2448e7d1dc02c/1771859251/dash_av1.mpd?t=1771942683","dash_h264":"https://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/3711540/482909058/41b6afeae4269d8a8760c5c368e2448e7d1dc02c/1771859251/dash_h264.mpd?t=1771942683","highlight":true,"hls_h264":"https://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/3711540/482909058/41b6afeae4269d8a8760c5c368e2448e7d1dc02c/1771859251/hls_264_master.m3u8?t=1771942683","id":257292878,"name":"Crit Happens! Next Fest Trailer","thumbnail":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/257292878/9158dfcd6ec6ca9d18f9b8f3dd99ff9bf94054c9/movie_600x337.jpg?t=1771942683"}],"name":"Crit Happens!","package_groups":[],"pc_requirements":{"minimum":"<strong>Minimum:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><strong>OS:</strong> Windows 10 or higher<br></li><li><strong>Processor:</strong> Intel Core i3 m380<br></li><li><strong>Memory:</strong> 2 GB RAM<br></li><li><strong>Graphics:</strong> Int